---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: 'site', text: 'About this site' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'now', text: 'Now' }
]
---

<PageLayout title='About' {headings}>
  <p>
    Hi, I am Strontium. This is my personal website for learning notes, project work, and ideas
    worth keeping.
  </p>

  <h2 id='site'>About this site</h2>
  <p>
    The site is still taking shape. New sections will be added gradually, with a focus on work I
    have made and can maintain myself.
  </p>

  <h2 id='now'>Now</h2>
  <p>
    The first stage is about establishing a clear profile, a project archive, and a reliable
    writing workflow. A fuller biography will follow.
  </p>

  <p>
    For now, you can find my public code on
    <a href='https://github.com/DA-cpu1' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer'>GitHub</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
